<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.100" end="00:00:04.799" style="s2">National champion, Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.800" end="00:00:10.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Callen.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:26.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can flip, but she can&#39;t stay on her</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.600" end="00:00:26.100" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.799" end="00:00:32.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a joke. Don&#39;t ruin the party.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.000" end="00:00:37.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What year is it?</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.799" end="00:00:38.599" style="s2">Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.099" end="00:00:41.320" style="s2">One little fall and you&#39;ve lost your</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.599" end="00:00:41.320" style="s2">mind? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.400" end="00:00:44.299" style="s2">Answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.500" end="00:00:46.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s 2026.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.299" end="00:00:46.799" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.099" end="00:00:53.000" style="s2">You&#39;re embarrassing me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.200" end="00:00:57.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw her push me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.200" end="00:01:00.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was playing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.000" end="00:01:04.900" style="s2">You grabbed her first.</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.198" end="00:01:09.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t blame him. You should be thanking</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.099" end="00:01:13.500" style="s2">me for inviting you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.900" end="00:01:13.500" style="s2">You pushed me then called it a joke.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.400" end="00:01:18.199" style="s2">So, what are you going to do?</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.800" end="00:01:22.000" style="s2">Let you enjoy the same joke.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.900" end="00:01:29.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She can&#39;t swim.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.500" end="00:01:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then put her feet down. It&#39;s shallow.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.000" end="00:01:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Callen, don&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.900" end="00:01:46.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed me in. He gave you my towel.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.900" end="00:01:51.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize to her</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.900" end="00:01:51.400" style="s2">or we&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.500" end="00:01:57.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re done.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.699" end="00:02:00.300" style="s2">Take your jersey.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.699" end="00:02:00.300" style="s2">Take your girl.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.792" end="00:02:05.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re dumping me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.092" end="00:02:05.992" style="s2">In front of everyone?</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.092" end="00:02:10.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted an answer? Everyone can hear</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.792" end="00:02:10.992" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.092" end="00:02:15.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want a dry towel?</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.492" end="00:02:22.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.392" end="00:02:24.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.892" end="00:02:27.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your ex.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.592" end="00:02:27.492" style="s2">Let go of my wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.392" end="00:02:32.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pick up my jersey.</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.692" end="00:02:32.492" style="s2">We can talk upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.692" end="00:02:36.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve picked up after you enough. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.292" end="00:02:41.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are teammates. You&#39;d really do</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.092" end="00:02:41.592" style="s2">this to me?</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.492" end="00:02:45.492" style="s2">She broke up with you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.192" end="00:02:47.092" style="s2">Let her leave.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.492" end="00:02:49.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m leaving with him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.092" end="00:02:49.892" style="s2">You&#39;re staying with her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:55.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, one-on-one.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.292" end="00:02:59.192" style="s2">Unless your captain&#39;s scared.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.992" end="00:03:03.092" style="s2">Tomorrow. First to three.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.192" end="00:03:03.092" style="s2">When I win, stay away from her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.092" end="00:03:08.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to bet with me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.192" end="00:03:12.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m playing basketball. She&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.992" end="00:03:12.392" style="s2">chosen.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.292" end="00:03:20.692" style="s2">Watch closely.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.592" end="00:03:20.692" style="s2">Your new guy&#39;s about to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.892" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop talking and shoot.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:28.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your tryouts at 9:00. We finish before</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.692" end="00:03:28.992" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.592" end="00:03:33.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8 minutes. Make them count.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.492" end="00:03:39.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First basket. Still want to switch</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.092" end="00:03:43.192" style="s2">sides?</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.892" end="00:03:45.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s one basket. Keep playing.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.192" end="00:03:46.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2-2. Next bail wins. You always choke</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.792" end="00:03:50.392" style="s2">when it matters.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.992" end="00:03:50.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, finish it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.692" end="00:03:59.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again, you&#39;ve got lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.892" end="00:04:01.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You picked the game. He won. Deal with</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.692" end="00:04:01.892" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.792" end="00:04:06.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.692" end="00:04:06.294" style="s2">Your turn to win.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.794" end="00:04:12.694" style="s2">Someone submitted your withdrawal.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.894" end="00:04:12.694" style="s2">Did you sign this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:23.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t withdraw.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.493" end="00:04:23.294" style="s2">Don&#39;t cross it out. I&#39;m competing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.494" end="00:04:27.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why is your name on this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.094" end="00:04:32.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t sign it. She submitted it. Ask</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.094" end="00:04:32.394" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.794" end="00:04:39.394" style="s2">You asked me to help.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.394" end="00:04:39.394" style="s2">Don&#39;t embarrass me now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.494" end="00:04:45.094" style="s2">Help me lose my spot. Say that louder.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.094" end="00:04:46.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, confirm it yourself. Are you</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.094" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">competing?</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.194" end="00:04:49.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, against her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:53.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still in. I&#39;ll keep this form.</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.794" end="00:04:58.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A new boyfriend won&#39;t make you a better</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.994" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">gymnast.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.494" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">Watch me. You might learn something.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.794" end="00:05:05.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be right here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.494" end="00:05:10.494" style="s2">Elara, first vault.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.994" end="00:05:12.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready.</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.494" end="00:05:14.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clean landing. One more than I picked</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.294" end="00:05:14.794" style="s2">the starter.</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.494" end="00:05:20.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you&#39;ve won?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.394" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.594" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">Watch the next one.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.094" end="00:05:27.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clear the runway.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.328" end="00:05:39.348" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.894" end="00:05:44.894" style="s2">Elara, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.118" end="00:05:51.594" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.194" end="00:05:54.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch that mat.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.594" end="00:05:55.194" style="s2">I was fixing it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.359" end="00:05:56.994" style="s2">[gasps and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.194" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">While I was running,</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.994" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">you were pulling it away.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.394" end="00:06:06.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw her. That&#39;s why I shouted.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.195" end="00:06:11.595" style="s2">Briella was helping. Stop making her the</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.195" end="00:06:11.595" style="s2">villain.</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.195" end="00:06:17.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I nearly hit the floor</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.095" end="00:06:17.895" style="s2">and you&#39;re defending her?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.695" end="00:06:26.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Callan, outside. Briella, you&#39;re done</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.195" end="00:06:29.295" style="s2">for today.</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.095" end="00:06:31.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re giving her my spot?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.295" end="00:06:34.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her first vault counts.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.195" end="00:06:34.295" style="s2">Elara gets the spot.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.995" end="00:06:37.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You couldn&#39;t beat me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.795" end="00:06:42.895" style="s2">So you moved the map.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.195" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The form stays with me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.895" end="00:06:46.295" style="s2">So does this incident report.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.295" end="00:06:52.895" style="s2">Elara,</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.795" end="00:06:52.895" style="s2">look at me. Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:56.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.695" end="00:07:00.695" style="s2">But you look terrified.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.295" end="00:07:05.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were in the air. I couldn&#39;t get to</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.495" end="00:07:05.695" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:11.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep looking at me like that and I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.895" end="00:07:11.795" style="s2">going to kiss you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.795" end="00:07:17.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please do.</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.695" end="00:07:23.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ooh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.395" end="00:07:30.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.995" end="00:07:32.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get a vote anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.995" end="00:07:34.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me my ticket. Briella is coming</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.595" end="00:07:34.995" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.795" end="00:07:39.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bought two. Neither one has your name.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.095" end="00:07:47.195" style="s2">Go alone. Nobody wants his teammates&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.395" end="00:07:47.195" style="s2">leftovers.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.995" end="00:07:52.595" style="s2">Noah, be my date tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.295" end="00:07:54.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this just to piss him off?</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.595" end="00:07:57.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kissed you because I wanted to.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.695" end="00:07:57.595" style="s2">Still want that ticket?</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.395" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.495" end="00:08:02.295" style="s2">And another kiss.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.095" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.995" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll You&#39;ll crawling back the first</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.497" end="00:08:14.797" style="s2">dance.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:14.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wear something nice. You&#39;ll be watching.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.397" end="00:08:20.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re staring.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.597" end="00:08:23.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You clean up pretty well, captain.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.197" end="00:08:23.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait until you see me dance.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.997" end="00:08:27.597" style="s2">Noah, they&#39;re taking the team photo.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.097" end="00:08:32.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.897" end="00:08:34.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One song.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.197" end="00:08:34.697" style="s2">Don&#39;t be late.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.896" end="00:08:41.797" style="s2">Watch your drink.</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.997" end="00:08:44.497" style="s2">Oops.</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.597" end="00:08:51.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you kidding me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.297" end="00:08:51.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She pushed my arm.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.197" end="00:08:56.897" style="s2">I moved. You missed.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wipe it off now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.797" end="00:09:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask the girl holding the glass.</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.397" end="00:09:06.997" style="s2">Keep the photo.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.697" end="00:09:10.597" style="s2">He looks better in red.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.397" end="00:09:16.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Photo&#39;s done.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.697" end="00:09:16.497" style="s2">Ready for that dance?</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.397" end="00:09:25.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made it before the song ended.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s only doing this to humiliate</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.497" end="00:09:28.097" style="s2">Callan.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.397" end="00:09:34.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking her, not you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.397" end="00:09:36.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then ask.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.497" end="00:09:41.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dance with me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.997" end="00:09:46.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gladly.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.497" end="00:09:52.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t rush that photo so you could</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.797" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">keep watching him.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.097" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m watching you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.997" end="00:10:00.697" style="s2">Elara Quinn?</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.497" end="00:10:03.997" style="s2">That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.297" end="00:10:09.497" style="s2">I&#39;ve seen your vault.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.897" end="00:10:09.497" style="s2">Try the bars.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.797" end="00:10:13.598" style="s2">You want to challenge me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.098" end="00:10:19.698" style="s2">I&#39;m in.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.498" end="00:10:22.198" style="s2">But we check the bars first.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.698" end="00:10:22.198" style="s2">Afraid?</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.298" end="00:10:26.698" style="s2">Of broken equipment?</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:26.698" style="s2">Absolutely.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.698" end="00:10:43.298" style="s2">Look. She&#39;s stalling already.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.698" end="00:10:47.198" style="s2">What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.298" end="00:10:49.198" style="s2">That support moved. Nobody gets on.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.198" end="00:10:50.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone back. Check it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.198" end="00:10:53.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s scared.</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.698" end="00:10:55.898" style="s2">Just say it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.298" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">Don&#39;t climb.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.898" end="00:10:59.598" style="s2">Watch the base.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.698" end="00:11:02.098" style="s2">Call that fear if you want. I&#39;m staying</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.598" end="00:11:02.098" style="s2">alive.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.698" end="00:11:10.598" style="s2">If I&#39;d been up there,</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.098" end="00:11:17.798" style="s2">you&#39;d be on the floor.</p>
