<p begin="00:23:48.506" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">I only need a cleaner routine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:51.006" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">She&#39;s adding the harder pass.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.636" end="00:24:06.311" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.291" end="00:24:06.311" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.706" end="00:24:13.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 9.85</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.806" end="00:24:16.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did exactly what she did.</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.406" end="00:24:16.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stepped on the landing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.006" end="00:24:19.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.506" end="00:24:27.206" style="s2">You can copy my moves.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.206" end="00:24:27.206" style="s2">You can&#39;t take my spot.</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.406" end="00:24:33.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, you&#39;re in. Congratulations.</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.007" end="00:24:40.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.307" end="00:24:41.507" style="s2">Tell him we both kept our promises.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.207" end="00:24:44.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We won,</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.507" end="00:24:44.607" style="s2">but I can&#39;t lift my arm.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.307" end="00:24:49.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.507" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Taking me to the house. Making fun of</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.007" end="00:24:51.207" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.507" end="00:24:59.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me the address. Don&#39;t tell me</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.307" end="00:25:02.507" style="s2">you&#39;re fine.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.907" end="00:25:05.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; County General.</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.507" end="00:25:05.907" style="s2">And you still owe me a victory kiss.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.007" end="00:25:11.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You scared me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.207" end="00:25:17.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.207" end="00:25:20.507" style="s2">Left side.</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.307" end="00:25:20.507" style="s2">The other one&#39;s not cooperating.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.582" end="00:25:23.602" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.607" end="00:25:28.907" style="s2">He&#39;s benched.</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.907" end="00:25:31.507" style="s2">You finally got your spot.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.907" end="00:25:33.607" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him drag you down.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.507" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lost me</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.607" end="00:25:38.407" style="s2">when you could still shoot.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.807" end="00:25:38.407" style="s2">Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.907" end="00:25:45.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, be serious.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.307" end="00:25:47.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.807" end="00:25:50.707" style="s2">That&#39;s my boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.807" end="00:25:50.707" style="s2">You&#39;re blocking the door.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.807" end="00:25:54.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She asked you to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.507" end="00:26:05.507" style="s2">I wanted you to see me</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.607" end="00:26:05.507" style="s2">holding the trophy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:08.407" end="00:26:11.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen you win.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.107" end="00:26:15.407" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to impress me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.807" end="00:26:18.407" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.907" end="00:26:21.407" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.707" end="00:26:36.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Noah, I&#39;ve reviewed your scans.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.709" end="00:26:40.409" style="s2">You&#39;ll need surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.809" end="00:26:48.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will I play again?</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.809" end="00:26:52.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Returning to basketball is possible.</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.909" end="00:26:52.009" style="s2">I can&#39;t promise when.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.109" end="00:26:55.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if surgery doesn&#39;t work?</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.209" end="00:27:04.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Waiting won&#39;t fix this.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.109" end="00:27:04.809" style="s2">Take a minute. I&#39;ll be outside.</p>
<p begin="00:27:09.409" end="00:27:11.909" style="s2">You should go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.809" end="00:27:15.809" style="s2">Your camp starts Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.309" end="00:27:21.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sending me to camp</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.309" end="00:27:21.209" style="s2">or breaking up with me?</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.909" end="00:27:27.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t ask you to wait for a guy</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.309" end="00:27:29.709" style="s2">who might never play again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.309" end="00:27:32.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.709" end="00:27:32.809" style="s2">Ask me to be your girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.009" end="00:27:39.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still want that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.099" end="00:27:43.409" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.754" end="00:27:45.409" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.409" end="00:27:48.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.409" end="00:27:51.509" style="s2">I&#39;ll train. You&#39;ll recover.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.809" end="00:27:51.509" style="s2">Sign when you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.409" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One condition.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.709" end="00:27:57.609" style="s2">You don&#39;t miss camp for me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.009" end="00:28:00.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.609" end="00:28:02.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.609" end="00:28:06.109" style="s2">Let&#39;s do it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.809" end="00:28:19.709" style="s2">Noah is finished.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.509" end="00:28:19.709" style="s2">I&#39;ll be leading this team now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.309" end="00:28:23.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has the coach confirmed that?</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.709" end="00:28:28.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask Alara.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:28.109" style="s2">She&#39;s right here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.509" end="00:28:34.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He got hurt winning for this team.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.309" end="00:28:34.710" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to bury him on camera.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.739" end="00:28:41.510" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.210" end="00:28:44.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody has to lead.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:44.310" style="s2">I&#39;m the top scorer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.944" end="00:28:49.110" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.510" end="00:28:49.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then score.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.510" end="00:28:52.910" style="s2">The coach hasn&#39;t made you captain.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.610" end="00:28:57.610" style="s2">Did Noah ask you to take over?</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.110" end="00:29:00.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He knows he can&#39;t play.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.610" end="00:29:00.810" style="s2">I&#39;m saying what everybody&#39;s thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.910" end="00:29:07.210" style="s2">Everybody doesn&#39;t include me.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.910" end="00:29:11.710" style="s2">Coach, I was protecting the team.</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.410" end="00:29:19.510" style="s2">Noah is our captain.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.310" end="00:29:19.510" style="s2">You&#39;re done speaking for this team.</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.110" end="00:29:24.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep that part in the video.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.710" end="00:29:26.810" style="s2">It&#39;s live.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.110" end="00:29:26.810" style="s2">They heard it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.410" end="00:29:32.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Satisfied?</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.610" end="00:29:35.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not until you tell them</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.410" end="00:29:35.210" style="s2">you made it up.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.710" end="00:29:42.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spoke too soon.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.910" end="00:29:42.210" style="s2">There hasn&#39;t been a captain change.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.210" end="00:29:50.410" style="s2">Coach, don&#39;t let him leave.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.710" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">Look at this angle.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.010" end="00:29:56.010" style="s2">I was trying to catch him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.810" end="00:30:00.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wasn&#39;t falling.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.910" end="00:30:04.710" style="s2">Play it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.110" end="00:30:04.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s the whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.820" end="00:30:09.840" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.610" end="00:30:17.310" style="s2">He cut in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.210" end="00:30:21.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You grabbed him before he fell.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.610" end="00:30:27.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted the ball.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.110" end="00:30:29.310" style="s2">I didn&#39;t mean for him to get hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.610" end="00:30:32.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You let him think</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.310" end="00:30:32.910" style="s2">he just landed wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.710" end="00:30:39.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your team access card, You&#39;re suspended</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.812" end="00:30:39.511" style="s2">pending review.</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.212" end="00:30:47.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t throw away my season over one</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.011" end="00:30:47.511" style="s2">play. Hand it over.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.111" end="00:31:00.712" style="s2">Did he pull me down?</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.212" end="00:31:03.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Coach has the video.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.712" end="00:31:03.411" style="s2">He&#39;s suspended.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.111" end="00:31:13.611" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let coach handle him.</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.911" end="00:31:16.312" style="s2">I&#39;ve got surgery to get through.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.611" end="00:31:16.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.511" end="00:31:33.611" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gymnastics coach, V.O., Brielle&#39;s taking</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.712" end="00:31:37.011" style="s2">back our loan to bars.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.611" end="00:31:37.011" style="s2">The showcase starts in an hour.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.011" end="00:31:44.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bencher or Falcon takes its bars back.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.111" end="00:31:46.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your family loaned us equipment.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.312" end="00:31:50.011" style="s2">They didn&#39;t buy our lineup.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.911" end="00:31:50.011" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then enjoy an empty stage.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.212" end="00:31:58.111" style="s2">The donors are already coming in. We</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.111" end="00:31:58.111" style="s2">still have the floor. Ava, get the team.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.812" end="00:32:10.011" style="s2">Without bars, you&#39;ve got nothing to</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.812" end="00:32:11.111" style="s2">show.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.011" end="00:32:14.611" style="s2">Funny.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.111" end="00:32:14.611" style="s2">Floor got me a 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.111" end="00:32:22.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One minute. Start together, finish</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.511" end="00:32:22.911" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.511" end="00:32:29.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lead, I&#39;ll take the left. No, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.911" end="00:32:29.411" style="s2">leading. I am on your right.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.011" end="00:32:34.312" style="s2">Scared to be front and center now?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.111" end="00:32:37.411" style="s2">It&#39;s a team.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.312" end="00:32:37.411" style="s2">You should try being on one.</p>
<p begin="00:32:52.813" end="00:32:55.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was ours.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.213" end="00:33:01.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara,</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.313" end="00:33:01.513" style="s2">don&#39;t take another step.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.713" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was just sore after the tie break.</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.713" end="00:33:14.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.713" end="00:33:14.613" style="s2">Let me see your ankle.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.913" end="00:33:27.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No fracture, a sprain.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.013" end="00:33:29.113" style="s2">No impact training until you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.313" end="00:33:32.313" style="s2">reassessed.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.113" end="00:33:32.313" style="s2">Camp starts Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.113" end="00:33:38.213" style="s2">You can report. You can&#39;t hide this.</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.043" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] Give me the camp</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.013" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">number.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.113" end="00:33:52.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara,</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.313" end="00:33:53.713" style="s2">are you withdrawing?</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.213" end="00:33:55.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.713" end="00:33:57.013" style="s2">I&#39;m injured.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.113" end="00:33:58.713" style="s2">I need a modified plan, not a</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.013" end="00:34:00.513" style="s2">replacement.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.713" end="00:34:02.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Report Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.513" end="00:34:06.113" style="s2">We&#39;re holding your place.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.313" end="00:34:06.113" style="s2">Medical staff will assess your training.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.243" end="00:34:10.212" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.613" end="00:34:10.212" style="s2">Still going?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.913" end="00:34:14.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still going. Help me pack.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.712" end="00:34:29.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worst victory parade ever.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.813" end="00:34:34.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can still show off our good sides.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.013" end="00:34:38.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.013" end="00:34:41.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.113" end="00:34:41.013" style="s2">I plan on keeping you.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.113" end="00:34:45.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Callum wants you to sign an accident</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.414" end="00:34:48.513" style="s2">statement. In exchange, he&#39;ll apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.513" end="00:34:48.513" style="s2">Then he can ask me himself.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.414" end="00:34:52.614" style="s2">Sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:50.614" end="00:34:55.314" style="s2">I apologize.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.614" end="00:34:55.314" style="s2">We all move on.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.414" end="00:34:59.314" style="s2">Read the first line.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.714" end="00:35:04.314" style="s2">The injury was accidental.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.714" end="00:35:07.014" style="s2">Accidental. You grabbed me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.314" end="00:35:07.014" style="s2">Write that.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.814" end="00:35:13.714" style="s2">Is this about Elara?</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.314" end="00:35:18.914" style="s2">She&#39;s at camp. This is about you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.214" end="00:35:20.514" style="s2">You saw me on the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.914" end="00:35:23.714" style="s2">You said nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:23.714" style="s2">Then you tried to take my team.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.914" end="00:35:27.314" style="s2">You really want to end my season?</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.714" end="00:35:30.014" style="s2">I want my shoulder back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.314" end="00:35:31.914" style="s2">Neither of us gets what we want.</p>
<p begin="00:35:30.014" end="00:35:33.114" style="s2">The suspension stands.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.914" end="00:35:35.114" style="s2">Noah&#39;s statement goes to the review</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.114" end="00:35:36.914" style="s2">panel.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.114" end="00:35:38.214" style="s2">I&#39;ll sign what happened, not your</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.914" end="00:35:40.214" style="s2">version.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.214" end="00:35:41.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brielle&#39;s observing as the alternate</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.214" end="00:35:43.914" style="s2">housing paired you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.914" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">Put me in any other room.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.914" end="00:35:48.414" style="s2">I&#39;ll check for another bed. For now,</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.814" end="00:35:48.414" style="s2">this is your key.</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.914" end="00:36:00.314" style="s2">Does he let every girl wear this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.614" end="00:36:07.214" style="s2">Let me answer.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.314" end="00:36:10.814" style="s2">Take your hand off my phone.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.414" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">He can decide if he&#39;s bothered.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.625" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">[snorts] He will on my call.</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.514" end="00:36:24.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara?</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.014" end="00:36:24.014" style="s2">Why is she wearing my jersey?</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.814" end="00:36:29.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. It&#39;s just a shirt.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.714" end="00:36:34.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s hers.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.714" end="00:36:34.414" style="s2">Take it off.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.114" end="00:36:42.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really picking a fight over clothes?</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.914" end="00:36:44.516" style="s2">No. You opened my bag.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.614" end="00:36:47.716" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.516" end="00:36:47.716" style="s2">Fine. Happy?</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.316" end="00:36:53.016" style="s2">Put it on the chair.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.716" end="00:36:57.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now put it on.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.016" end="00:36:57.916" style="s2">I want to see you in it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.716" end="00:37:03.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still owe me that trophy photo.</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.716" end="00:37:05.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You get the guy, too.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.115" end="00:37:05.916" style="s2">Injured addition.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.816" end="00:37:12.716" style="s2">Room 212.</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.016" end="00:37:16.115" style="s2">I&#39;ve changed your assignment.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.716" end="00:37:16.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Help me carry this.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.916" end="00:37:23.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, tomorrow you review Brielle&#39;s new</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.016" end="00:37:26.916" style="s2">floor pass. No landings for you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.316" end="00:37:26.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see if she can do more than talk.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.115" end="00:37:32.716" style="s2">New pass, more difficulty. Try keeping</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.216" end="00:37:36.115" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.716" end="00:37:36.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, what needs changing?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.216" end="00:37:41.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her starting mark. It&#39;s too far forward.</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.316" end="00:37:47.516" style="s2">You want to fix me? Get up and show me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.216" end="00:37:50.115" style="s2">I don&#39;t need another injury to read a</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.516" end="00:37:50.115" style="s2">white line.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.216" end="00:37:58.615" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.916" end="00:38:02.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She lands here, outside. Move the start</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.615" end="00:38:02.416" style="s2">back and the whole pass moves with it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.916" end="00:38:05.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I still miss?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.416" end="00:38:10.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we review it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.816" end="00:38:10.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One controlled run. I&#39;ll watch the mark.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.416" end="00:38:19.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look so pleased.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.615" end="00:38:23.216" style="s2">Don&#39;t step out. Easier for both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.115" end="00:38:23.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, lead tonight&#39;s video review.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.516" end="00:38:31.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mom drove me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.316" end="00:38:39.115" style="s2">His rehab&#39;s in California.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.016" end="00:38:39.115" style="s2">I booked Friday&#39;s flight.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.516" end="00:38:48.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.115" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">that wasn&#39;t decided.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.517" end="00:38:54.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eight weeks. The clinic starts Monday.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.517" end="00:38:58.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you booked Friday without asking me?</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.317" end="00:39:02.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I booked away home. You need a plan.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.317" end="00:39:02.117" style="s2">He&#39;s right here. Ask him.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.617" end="00:39:07.617" style="s2">I&#39;m asking whether he&#39;s choosing</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.917" end="00:39:07.617" style="s2">recovery or staying near you.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.117" end="00:39:16.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t be his excuse to skip rehab.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.017" end="00:39:20.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you don&#39;t get to use rehab to break</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.217" end="00:39:20.617" style="s2">us up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.917" end="00:39:23.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell me what you&#39;re doing.</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.517" end="00:39:27.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking the program.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.917" end="00:39:30.617" style="s2">I fly Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.217" end="00:39:30.617" style="s2">Friday, I&#39;m watching her showcase.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eight weeks. You call, I answer. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.017" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">still us.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.817" end="00:39:39.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every night.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:49.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saturday.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.117" end="00:39:49.517" style="s2">But I&#39;m coming to that showcase.</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.317" end="00:39:57.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sloan, you&#39;re up. Alila, you&#39;re her</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.317" end="00:39:57.717" style="s2">corner.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.917" end="00:40:02.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I freeze, don&#39;t let me stand there.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.017" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">Find me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:04.017" end="00:40:06.717" style="s2">I&#39;ll count you back in.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.112" end="00:40:31.317" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.717" end="00:40:33.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I lost it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.317" end="00:40:35.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eyes on me. Next pose</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.617" end="00:40:37.617" style="s2">on my count.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.817" end="00:40:39.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Track&#39;s dead.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.617" end="00:40:41.617" style="s2">She should stop.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.417" end="00:40:45.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not done. Five,</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.617" end="00:40:45.917" style="s2">six, seven, eight.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.117" end="00:40:52.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch the laptop.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.718" end="00:40:54.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.818" end="00:40:55.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why is it paused?</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.918" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Briella,</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.918" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">step away.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.483" end="00:41:05.918" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.918" end="00:41:09.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept me in it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:05.918" end="00:41:09.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finished. I just counted.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.318" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I see why he wanted Friday.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.618" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worth staying for.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.018" end="00:41:26.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alera,</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.318" end="00:41:27.318" style="s2">we reviewed your state trial.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.218" end="00:41:29.918" style="s2">This is your national showcase</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.318" end="00:41:29.918" style="s2">invitation.</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.118" end="00:41:36.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As a gymnast?</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.718" end="00:41:38.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All four events, six weeks, accept by</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.118" end="00:41:39.618" style="s2">six tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.618" end="00:41:42.118" style="s2">You&#39;ll need medical clearance to</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.618" end="00:41:42.118" style="s2">compete.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.218" end="00:41:49.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t take it,</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.418" end="00:41:49.918" style="s2">I will.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.318" end="00:41:55.618" style="s2">You can&#39;t even stand without a boot.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.918" end="00:42:00.518" style="s2">And you needed a pause button</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.918" end="00:42:02.718" style="s2">to stop someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.518" end="00:42:05.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your volunteer access ends now. Leave</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.718" end="00:42:05.318" style="s2">the badge.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.018" end="00:42:09.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re picking her again?</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.918" end="00:42:11.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m removing the person who stopped the</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.318" end="00:42:11.918" style="s2">music.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.918" end="00:42:21.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t sign just to shut her up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.718" end="00:42:25.818" style="s2">I wanted this before I knew her name.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.918" end="00:42:28.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then sign for you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.818" end="00:42:29.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I accept. My medical team decides when I</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.218" end="00:42:31.818" style="s2">train.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.618" end="00:42:34.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send this to your coach. Your university</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.818" end="00:42:37.318" style="s2">must confirm its entry.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.518" end="00:42:37.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll earn that, too.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.718" end="00:42:43.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Airport tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.118" end="00:42:43.118" style="s2">Save me a real goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.318" end="00:42:47.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d better show up early.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.320" end="00:43:06.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put this on.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.820" end="00:43:13.520" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you home.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.120" end="00:43:20.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already have a ride</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.320" end="00:43:21.320" style="s2">and a boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.380" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.320" end="00:43:24.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For eight weeks he won&#39;t be here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.720" end="00:43:29.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eight weeks doesn&#39;t make you my</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.720" end="00:43:29.320" style="s2">boyfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:43:31.520" end="00:43:37.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put your shirt away.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.120" end="00:43:37.420" style="s2">You can&#39;t keep her waiting forever.</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.420" end="00:43:42.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s not keeping me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:40.120" end="00:43:42.920" style="s2">I&#39;m choosing him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.020" end="00:43:46.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t even be here for your showcase.</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.920" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">That&#39;s between us.</p>
<p begin="00:43:48.620" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get a vote.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.020" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now,</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.320" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">that goodbye.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.920" end="00:44:04.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You leaving or trying to make me miss</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.520" end="00:44:06.520" style="s2">you more?</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.220" end="00:44:06.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.920" end="00:44:11.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to go.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.420" end="00:44:18.120" style="s2">Go get your shoulder back.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.420" end="00:44:18.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go get your place.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.620" end="00:44:29.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One university entry. Selection in four</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.120" end="00:44:30.920" style="s2">weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:44:29.220" end="00:44:32.520" style="s2">If you&#39;re cleared,</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.920" end="00:44:34.020" style="s2">you&#39;re competing against Ava.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.520" end="00:44:36.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you healthy.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.020" end="00:44:36.820" style="s2">I still want to win.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.320" end="00:44:41.220" style="s2">Go on.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.520" end="00:44:44.220" style="s2">One jump.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.220" end="00:44:44.220" style="s2">Unless you&#39;re scared.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.420" end="00:44:51.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m injured.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.620" end="00:44:51.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re desperate for a video.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.220" end="00:44:56.121" style="s2">Get us both the frame.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.721" end="00:45:02.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re just handing her your place?</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.321" end="00:45:04.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I&#39;m beating her when she can fight</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.421" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.321" end="00:45:09.521" style="s2">4 weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.321" end="00:45:09.521" style="s2">Keep recording when I win.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.521" end="00:45:14.721" style="s2">My name stays on the list.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.121" end="00:45:17.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until selection.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.721" end="00:45:20.121" style="s2">No medical clearance, no competition.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.221" end="00:45:20.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give me the form.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.921" end="00:45:28.221" style="s2">Not the withdrawal form.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.421" end="00:45:28.221" style="s2">The training plan.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.721" end="00:45:41.221" style="s2">You can return to full training</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.621" end="00:45:48.021" style="s2">under your coach&#39;s supervision.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.321" end="00:45:56.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1 week until selection.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.621" end="00:45:56.121" style="s2">Only the routine we&#39;ve agreed on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.521" end="00:46:08.421" style="s2">Elara,</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.721" end="00:46:08.421" style="s2">are we stopping?</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.921" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I&#39;m finishing this.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.621" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">Eyes on the bar.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.621" end="00:46:17.821" style="s2">Don&#39;t cut the release. That&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.621" end="00:46:19.921" style="s2">routine I&#39;m competing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.821" end="00:46:22.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then show me you can finish it,</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.921" end="00:46:22.821" style="s2">not just catch it.</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.121" end="00:46:35.721" style="s2">That routine goes to selection.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.521" end="00:46:38.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, I&#39;m back?</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.721" end="00:46:38.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.321" end="00:46:44.121" style="s2">I watched you catch that bar.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:47.221" style="s2">I forgot to breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.121" end="00:46:49.921" style="s2">Does this mean I get my jersey back?</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.221" end="00:46:51.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come home and win it back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.921" end="00:46:53.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, me,</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.121" end="00:46:57.521" style="s2">no audience.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.021" end="00:46:57.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still talking big with one good arm.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.921" end="00:47:01.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.022" end="00:47:01.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; liked that arm at the airport.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.822" end="00:47:05.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re all still here.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.722" end="00:47:12.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.122" end="00:47:22.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my best.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.922" end="00:47:22.622" style="s2">Now beat it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.022" end="00:47:28.522" style="s2">Watch me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.722" end="00:47:34.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.722" end="00:47:38.822" style="s2">Finish it, Alara.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.422" end="00:47:48.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, 9.95, tied.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.722" end="00:47:50.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All that drama just to tie?</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.277" end="00:47:51.722" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.122" end="00:47:53.518" style="s2">You came back to film.</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.722" end="00:47:56.522" style="s2">Don&#39;t stop now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.518" end="00:47:56.522" style="s2">[applause] You didn&#39;t beat me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.622" end="00:48:02.522" style="s2">Three events left.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.522" end="00:48:10.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That landing, you made everybody shut</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.522" end="00:48:13.122" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.922" end="00:48:14.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody except you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.122" end="00:48:16.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m saving the quiet part for when I get</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.422" end="00:48:16.722" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.722" end="00:48:21.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the good arm, too.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.922" end="00:48:27.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Phones away. Beam warm-up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.322" end="00:48:37.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see that ankle on the beam.</p>
<p begin="00:48:38.022" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">My doctor cleared me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.922" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to examine me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.922" end="00:48:49.822" style="s2">I&#39;m not giving you this event.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.822" end="00:48:52.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.822" end="00:48:52.622" style="s2">I don&#39;t want a gift.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.422" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.622" end="00:48:57.422" style="s2">you&#39;re first on beam.</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.924" end="00:49:07.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay on, Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.188" end="00:49:10.724" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.324" end="00:49:10.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m on.</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.524" end="00:49:17.413" style="s2">Elara, 9.90.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.393" end="00:49:17.413" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.324" end="00:49:22.924" style="s2">Ava, 9.85.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.124" end="00:49:27.724" style="s2">You&#39;re ahead by 5 hundredths.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.424" end="00:49:30.824" style="s2">Don&#39;t get comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.724" end="00:49:30.824" style="s2">I was just starting to enjoy it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.124" end="00:49:37.624" style="s2">You&#39;re greening. Did you win?</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:42.524" style="s2">Two events, halfway.</p>
<p begin="00:49:40.324" end="00:49:44.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t look at her score.</p>
<p begin="00:49:42.524" end="00:49:46.179" style="s2">Watch where she lands.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.524" end="00:49:47.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re coaching me now?</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.179" end="00:49:49.924" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.324" end="00:49:51.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m good at watching you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.924" end="00:49:53.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounded better before you said it</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.024" end="00:49:53.324" style="s2">out loud.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.324" end="00:50:00.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.724" end="00:50:11.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the new ending.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.824" end="00:50:11.024" style="s2">I told you I wanted to win.</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.924" end="00:50:16.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which version?</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.624" end="00:50:18.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The full routine.</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.124" end="00:50:21.624" style="s2">Keep the last pass.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:21.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then finish it on your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.824" end="00:50:29.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Worst.</p>
<p begin="00:50:27.444" end="00:50:29.464" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.624" end="00:50:33.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay inside, Elara.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.824" end="00:50:37.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish the one you chose.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.324" end="00:50:53.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, 9.85.</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.924" end="00:50:56.724" style="s2">Ava leads by 5 hundredths.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.624" end="00:50:56.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have picked the easy one.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.724" end="00:51:02.625" style="s2">I picked this one. I own it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.024" end="00:51:05.525" style="s2">You think a boot comes off?</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.625" end="00:51:05.525" style="s2">And your magically back?</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.125" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">And yet my name&#39;s on the scoreboard.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.325" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">Where&#39;s yours?</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.225" end="00:51:20.525" style="s2">You&#39;ll see it soon enough.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.725" end="00:51:26.025" style="s2">Last event, no room for another step.</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.425" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.525" end="00:51:31.425" style="s2">I&#39;ll stick this one.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:34.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you win, I&#39;m keeping that</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.425" end="00:51:34.025" style="s2">screenshot.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.125" end="00:51:39.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t crop out the score.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.325" end="00:51:39.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or my girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.425" end="00:51:44.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vault, which version?</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.325" end="00:51:52.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The one I&#39;ve landed all week.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.525" end="00:51:55.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One scored attempt each.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.125" end="00:51:55.025" style="s2">Ava goes first.</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.215" end="00:51:57.235" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.125" end="00:52:04.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.925" end="00:52:08.525" style="s2">I stepped.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.225" end="00:52:13.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ava, 9.85, total 39.60.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.525" end="00:52:16.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need 9.95 to win. 9.90 ties.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.525" end="00:52:16.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;m not aiming for a tie.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.625" style="s2">That&#39;s still my best total.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.125" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">Make yours better.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.625" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">Watch the landing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.826" end="00:52:39.525" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.125" end="00:52:42.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.525" end="00:52:43.925" style="s2">Total 39.65.</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.376" end="00:52:46.306" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.925" end="00:52:49.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.306" end="00:52:49.825" style="s2">[gasps] You made me earn it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.511" end="00:52:55.531" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.225" end="00:53:01.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smile.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.725" end="00:53:04.525" style="s2">I&#39;m taking the screenshot.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.625" end="00:53:04.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you get the score?</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.625" end="00:53:09.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And girlfriend.</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.327" end="00:53:14.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m confirming your university entry</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.927" end="00:53:17.627" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.027" end="00:53:17.627" style="s2">The showcase is in two weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.627" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won the club trial.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.527" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">See you on my floor.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.727" end="00:53:32.227" style="s2">Those are practice bars.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.927" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">My slot is on the competition set.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.227" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">This is my family&#39;s gym.</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.327" end="00:53:40.827" style="s2">You use what we give you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.327" end="00:53:40.827" style="s2">Then why is your name on the real set?</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.227" end="00:53:48.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I train here [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.327" end="00:53:51.527" style="s2">and I compete here tomorrow. Move.</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.527" end="00:53:54.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her slot starts now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.527" end="00:53:56.027" style="s2">Open the arena.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.327" end="00:53:59.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t expect me to help you. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.027" end="00:53:59.327" style="s2">expecting you to get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:54:00.927" end="00:54:03.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the feel we needed.</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.027" end="00:54:09.427" style="s2">You caught it cleaner than last week.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.427" end="00:54:15.127" style="s2">Send it to Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.727" end="00:54:24.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d rather see it live.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.827" end="00:54:29.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a video call.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.927" end="00:54:31.627" style="s2">That counts.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.127" end="00:54:35.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not the same.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.627" end="00:54:35.227" style="s2">Turn around. side.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.727" end="00:54:46.027" style="s2">Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.447" end="00:54:53.127" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.727" end="00:54:55.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re supposed to be in California.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.127" end="00:54:58.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surgery tomorrow. Flight back Sunday.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.827" end="00:55:01.227" style="s2">I&#39;m still doing the eight weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.927" end="00:55:04.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You flew here for a checkup?</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.227" end="00:55:04.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And one very distracting gymnast.</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.528" end="00:55:17.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a curfew.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.728" end="00:55:17.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;d better not waste it.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.828" end="00:55:23.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your coach is standing right here.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.328" end="00:55:29.928" style="s2">10 minutes,</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.728" end="00:55:29.928" style="s2">then I&#39;m going back to my team.</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.368" end="00:55:33.388" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.228" end="00:55:37.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop talking.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.028" end="00:55:46.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cute. You brought a cheering section.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.328" end="00:55:51.028" style="s2">You brought a whole building.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.128" end="00:55:53.528" style="s2">Still nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.028" end="00:55:54.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Opening rotation, vault. Brielle, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.528" end="00:55:56.728" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.628" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch. This is what home advantage looks</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.728" end="00:55:59.128" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.628" end="00:56:15.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brielle, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.028" end="00:56:18.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the number. Catch it. You landed</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.228" end="00:56:18.228" style="s2">it. So can I.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.128" end="00:56:27.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, 9.95, tied.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.428" end="00:56:32.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t look at me once.</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.728" end="00:56:36.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was busy landing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.828" end="00:56:36.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep doing that. I&#39;ll keep watching.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.928" end="00:56:41.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next rotation, bars.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.928" end="00:56:47.528" style="s2">Brielle, 9.90.</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.328" end="00:56:47.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:04.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alara, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.928" end="00:57:04.928" style="s2">Alara leads by 500ths.</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.689" end="00:57:10.628" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.128" end="00:57:11.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying not to yell. My mom isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.628" end="00:57:14.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.329" end="00:57:14.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to hear you both.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:19.429" style="s2">Two events left.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.229" end="00:57:23.429" style="s2">You&#39;re not taking my podium.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.429" end="00:57:27.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought my own feet.</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.629" end="00:57:33.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brielle, beam,</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.529" end="00:57:33.929" style="s2">you&#39;re up.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.529" end="00:57:43.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brielle, 9.95.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.929" end="00:57:53.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, 4.90. Both totals 29.80.</p>
<p begin="00:57:51.429" end="00:57:53.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tied.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.929" end="00:57:56.729" style="s2">Floor decides it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:58.829" end="00:58:01.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That ending you helped me fix,</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.729" end="00:58:07.129" style="s2">watch it win.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.729" end="00:58:07.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brielle, 9.95. Total 39.75.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.729" end="00:58:11.329" style="s2">Remember where you start.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.229" end="00:58:13.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been practicing that landing for</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.329" end="00:58:13.929" style="s2">two weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.929" end="00:58:30.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elara, 10.0. Total 39.80.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.229" end="00:58:30.029" style="s2">First place.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.329" end="00:58:34.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.929" end="00:58:40.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In my gym,</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.929" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">your gym,</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.029" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">my score.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.929" end="00:58:51.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got the picture?</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.829" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">Now I want the real thing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.629" end="00:58:54.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came all this way.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.229" end="00:58:57.929" style="s2">Come closer.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.629" end="00:59:04.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to tell them what I did to your</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.629" end="00:59:06.729" style="s2">shoulder.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.029" end="00:59:06.729" style="s2">Then hit the button.</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.229" end="00:59:12.629" style="s2">I pulled Noah&#39;s arm.</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.229" end="00:59:12.629" style="s2">Then I lied to protect my spot.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.729" end="00:59:17.131" style="s2">Coach has my signed statement.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.931" end="00:59:19.931" style="s2">I&#39;m leaving the team.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.131" end="00:59:22.431" style="s2">I accept the apology.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.931" end="00:59:24.730" style="s2">The report stays.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.431" end="00:59:24.730" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.431" end="00:59:29.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let us throw.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.431" end="00:59:37.730" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look like you won more than a medal.</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.306" end="00:59:40.326" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.331" end="00:59:47.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time</p>
<p begin="00:59:44.631" end="00:59:47.331" style="s2">I picked me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.531" end="00:59:53.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.331" end="00:59:55.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can keep up.</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.230" end="00:59:58.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still doing rehab.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.431" end="00:59:59.831" style="s2">You know this comeback isn&#39;t quick.</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.631" end="01:00:00.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.831" end="01:00:03.531" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a lot of winning for you to</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.931" end="01:00:03.531" style="s2">watch.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.931" end="01:00:10.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Score here!</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.631" end="01:00:21.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s our captain, Wright Dolphin.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.031" end="01:00:26.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I get my jersey back now?</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.230" end="01:00:30.051" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can have a kiss.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.931" end="01:00:31.031" style="s2">The jersey stays.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.051" end="01:00:33.431" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.031" end="01:00:33.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
